{:edb/db-before-t 1028 :edb/db-after-t 1029 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534341 50 #inst "2026-10-11T19:24:11.920Z" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186128570 13194139534341 17592186045417 false] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186128571 13194139534341 17592186045417 false] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186128572 13194139534341 17592186045417 false] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186128573 13194139534341 17592186045417 false] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419645 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419646 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419647 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186128569 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419648 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186128569 1078 #edb/ref 17592186419647 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186129188 1038 #edb/ref 17592186419654 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186129848 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186129848 1071 "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{R}\\frac{1-3x{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}A$,  where $R=[1,e]\\times [2,3].$" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186129848 1071 "Evaluate the double integral $∬_(R)\\frac{1 - 3xy^{2}}{x}dA$, where $R = [1, e] \\cdot [2, 3]$." 13194139534341 17592186045417 false] [17592186129848 1074 "Using the linearity property of double integrals, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\frac{1-3x{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{R}(\\frac{1}{x}-3{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{R}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}A-{∬}_{R}3{y}^{2}\\text{ }\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function under the first integral is independent of $y.$ So, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\frac{1}{x}\\text{ }\\text{d}A & =(3-2){\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|]_{1}^{e} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1) \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function under the second integral is independent of $x.$ So, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}3{y}^{2}\\text{ }\\text{d}A & =(e-1){\\int }_{2}^{3}3{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =(e-1)[{y}^{3}]_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =(e-1)({3}^{3}-{2}^{3}) \\\\  & =19(e-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, combining our results, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\frac{1-3x{y}^{2}}{x}\\,\\text{d}A=1-19(e-1)=20-19e.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1043 #edb/ref 17592186419655 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1043 #edb/ref 17592186419656 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1043 #edb/ref 17592186419657 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1045 "Properties of Double Integrals" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1046 #edb/ref 17592186419655 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046659 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050546 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419643 1053 #uuid "abdc4a65-40f3-528e-9141-f38a1d8b8f37" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419644 1080 "-4" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419644 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419644 1083 #uuid "168581f2-f17c-5d44-a38c-f447560aea9e" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419645 1080 "19e-2" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419645 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419645 1083 #uuid "216a895e-32d8-5d87-938d-db65b2d1bddc" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419646 1080 "19-20e" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419646 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419646 1083 #uuid "4a5a35ab-9584-5250-9b05-bab514871947" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] [17592186419647 1080 "20-19e" 13194139534341 17592186045417 true] 